OL,3,AReform UK councillor charged with rape
OL,4,Aand sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Reform UK in Hampshire
OL,7,Fhas been charged with 35 offences
OL,8,Fagainst four victims over a 13-year
OL,9,Fperiod, including 12 counts of rape.
OL,11,FThe Crown Prosecution Service (CPS)
OL,12,Fsaid it had charged George Madgwick
OL,13,Fwith the offences, which it said took
OL,14,Fplace between 2008 and 2021 in
OL,15,FPortsmouth and Wales.
OL,17,FIt said the 37-year-old faced charges
OL,18,Fincluding rape, sexual assault,
OL,19,Fcontrolling or coercive behaviour, and
OL,20,Fmaking indecent images of a child
OL,21,Fagainst four victims - who were aged 16
OL,22,Fand 17 at the time.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
