OL,3,AReform UK councillor charged with rape
OL,4,Aand sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK said Madgwick had been
OL,7,Fsuspended "with immediate effect". He
OL,8,Fis due to appear at Portsmouth
OL,9,FMagistrates' Court on 25 November.
